      "text": "Plans don't fail at planning."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.88,
      "end": 4.76,
      "text": "They fail at the first surprise."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.14,
      "end": 22.150000000000002,
      "text": "PlanB schedules a real dinner: owners, dependencies, equipment, a budget —"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.41,
      "end": 26.17,
      "text": "checked by a constraint engine, and re-checked by an independent validator."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.459999999999994,
      "end": 53.37,
      "text": "Now the surprise: guests an hour early, and no oven."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.769999999999996,
      "end": 55.97,
      "text": "PlanB first shows what it understood —"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.18,
      "end": 58.12,
      "text": "nothing moves until you confirm."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.33,
      "end": 106.21,
      "text": "Every change is explained by the constraint that forced it."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.61999999999999,
      "end": 108.85,
      "text": "New finish: five fifty-five —"
    },
    {
      "start": 109.11999999999999,
      "end": 111.00999999999999,
      "text": "five minutes before the guests walk in."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.57000000000002,
      "end": 131.58,
      "text": "A second shock, absorbed."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.83,
      "end": 135.24,
      "text": "And the plan remembers — this session survives a reload."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.88000000000002,
      "end": 154.83,
      "text": "And when no plan exists, PlanB says so —"
    },
    {
      "start": 154.99,
      "end": 157.67000000000002,
      "text": "it never invents time, people, or money."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.99,
      "end": 160.85,
      "text": "In its own audit: zero broken constraints."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.08,
      "end": 164.94,
      "text": "PlanB Orchestra — a simulated Alexa+ experience."
    }
